WEBVTT

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:05.900
I wonder if the Great Jahy is already there!

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.110
It's dangerous to cross at intersections
without stopping and looking both ways.

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:32.920
Please be careful in the future.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.680
I... I will.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.150
Th-Thank you!

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:01.350
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:02.140
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:03.640
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.430
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:06.380
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:21.530
<b>Restoration Plan No. 10

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:27.290
We didn't find any mana 
crystals today either...

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.080
Do you know any places bigger than this?

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:34.320
Yeah! There's a park beyond the train 
station. It's bigger than this one.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.300
We should go there next time, Great Jahy.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:41.440
Oh, hey, Great Jahy...

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:45.020
I met a magical girl today.

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:45.880
What?

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:47.980
Are you serious?

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.030
Yeah!

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:52.150
Looks like they're real.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.940
Not just something from manga and anime.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.650
She was so cool!

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:00.610
Great Jahy?

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:03.090
<i>Damn that magical girl...</i>

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:07.040
<i>It's not just my mana crystal...
She's trying to steal Kokoro's heart, too?!</i>

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:14.500
Oh... Oh, <i>boy</i>. Kokoro, you really don't 
have an eye for this kind of thing.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:19.170
Can't you see someone much more
impressive standing before you now?

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:26.890
But the magical girl was way bigger than you.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.790
She seemed really strong, too.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:34.350
Oh, but I'm also big and strong!

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:39.110
I guess I haven't shown you my true form yet.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.240
Your true form?

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:48.120
I can transform, you know.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.910
Well? Wanna see?

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:51.340
I do!

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.680
Huh? I can't hear you.

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:56.340
Say it louder.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:57.850
I want to see it!

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.260
Louder!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.800
I want to see it!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:06.010
Well, if you're <i>that</i> insistent, 
I guess you leave me no choice.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.330
Behold my true form...

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:11.270
Feast your eyes upon me!

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:29.860
So, what do you think, Kokoro?

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:32.290
This is my real form!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.000
Great Jahy, that's so cool!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.460
You're so beautiful!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:38.670
Just wonderful!

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.060
That's right!

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:46.130
I'm cool, beautiful, and wonderful.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:50.810
Go on... Keep singing my praises!

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.540
You're so stylish!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:53.440
Yup, yup.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.060
And grown-up!

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:55.650
That's right.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:57.330
I'm so surprised!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.460
Aren't you just?

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:00.000
You're so strong!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.280
That's it, that's it!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.740
<i>I'm not losing Kokoro to that nerd!</i>

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.420
Say, Great Jahy,

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.420
could you pick that up?

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.710
Amazing!

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:27.220
Right?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:30.390
That was... nothing...

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.710
Could do... this in my... sleep...

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.310
Wow, wow, wow!

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:38.370
Oh, oh, oh!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:39.380
What about magic?

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:41.020
Can you do magic?!

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.480
I... sure can!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.120
It's magic!

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:01.170
How was that?

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.420
You're amazing!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:12.120
I guess you understand my true power now.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.100
Yeah!

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:19.100
You're cooler and stronger 
than anyone I know!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.050
Really?

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:23.610
Yeah, really!

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.390
I see.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:34.550
Oh, no!

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:35.990
I've gotta get going.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.520
What, already?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:41.710
Yeah. We'll have to continue our
search for mana crystals some other time.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:42.910
Okay!

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.390
Man...

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:50.280
Didn't think I'd be using 
my powers in such a way.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:06.480
Don't tell me this is who 
Kokoro was talking about...

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.170
Hup!

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:08.480
There!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.510
That's it!

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:11.430
Yes!

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.980
Couldn't be.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.980
Come on!

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.140
One more!

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.180
Good!

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.700
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.140
What's wrong, Hy-chan?

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:22.960
Sorry.

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:29.320
<i>The Great Jahy had to take the night off
because she'd used up too much of her power.</i>

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:34.430
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.430
Hy-chan, could you get the phone please?

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:40.520
<i>I can't go on like this.</i>

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.910
<i>I'll never be able to win against 
that magical girl this way.</i>

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.490
Hy-chan, the phone!

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:48.340
Would you answer it?

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.450
Thank you for calling. This is Pub Maou.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:56.280
A reservation?

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:58.370
Yes, of course!

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.660
We'll see you later.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:04.250
You've gotten really good at 
answering the phone properly.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:09.920
In the beginning, you didn't even know how to 
pick up the receiver and you'd get so flustered.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.690
Of course I did!

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:14.970
I am the Great Jahy, 
second-in-command of the Dark Realm!

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.830
Besides, who could have dreamed
 the day would come

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.770
that I had to answer the phone 
and make nice with humans?!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:24.720
You're not just a mere shift lead. 
You're like the shift master!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:28.860
Well, you're still our only employee, but...

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:32.570
If you get it, then hire some 
more people already!

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.100
<i>Damn it.</i>

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:36.770
<i>I'm not here to become a shift master.</i>

00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:37.610
<i>Remember!</i>

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:38.780
<i>I'm...</i>

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:45.020
<i>the one that all the Dark Realm
 feared, revered, and served!</i>

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:49.180
And now I'm growing accustomed 
to the human world?!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:52.590
Bowing my head to humans?  
That's absolutely unthinkable!

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:54.770
An absolute travesty I cannot brook!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:56.050
Thank you!

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.420
Oh, see you two later!

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.260
Thank you so much for coming!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:04.050
Another great job tonight, Jahy-chan.

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:05.480
We'll be back.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:07.320
We look forward to it!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.770
Hy-chan, that was lovely smile just now.

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:15.860
Shut up!

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.220
<i>I'm only doing this for the mana crystals...</i>

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:22.090
<i>I have no choice 
but to work here to survive.</i>

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:25.470
<i>I don't need to pander to these humans.</i>

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:29.330
Wasabi octopus, some edamame, 
and three beers, please!

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:30.750
Coming right up!

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.590
<i>And yet...</i>

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:34.770
Do you have any other recommendations today?

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:35.970
Our tempura!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.260
Oh, then I'll take that!

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.430
Good choice!

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:40.770
<i>And yet...</i>

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:43.250
Excuse me! Could we order, too, please?

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.520
Coming!

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.730
<i>My body...</i>

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.080
<i>keeps moving...</i>

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:57.610
<i>It's like I'm being controlled by the boss!</i>

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.700
<i>I'm the Dark Realm's second-in-command.</i>

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:06.830
<i>Feared and revered by all...</i>

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:09.540
I hate this!

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:14.000
<i>At this rate, I'll... I'll... I'll...</i>

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:20.890
<i>Not only will I fail to get the 
mana crystals from that magical girl...</i>

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.860
<i>I'll cease to be who I really am.</i>

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.490
Are you okay, Hy-chan?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.070
It's all your fault...

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.720
that I adapted to you humans...

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:46.460
that I got used to being nice to you...

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.620
It's all your fault!

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:52.490
I'm the Dark Realm's second-in-command!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.080
Maybe you haven't realized it,

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:17.360
but isn't the reason you've 
been smiling so much lately

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:20.490
because you're having fun working?

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:23.160
Fun?

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.230
Yes.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:29.140
You've welcomed so many people 
tonight with your smile.

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:32.200
You put smiles on all their faces,

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.630
and maybe that's the real reason
 you're so happy.

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:39.250
You wouldn't be able to give
such a wonderful smile otherwise.

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:42.340
Come on. Stand up.

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:51.380
<i>I see...</i>

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:55.630
<i>I'm having fun at work.</i>

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.400
As if!

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:01.960
You can't fool me with your words!

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:03.390
You're not getting me!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:04.570
Oh my.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.120
This place...

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:12.580
As soon as I've gathered the mana 
crystals and restored the Dark Realm,

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:17.000
I'm quitting this place!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.360
Good luck, Hy-chan.

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:38.210
I'm so sorry!

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:39.220
Are you all right?

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:41.490
Yes. Please don't worry.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.640
I'm sorry! Are you okay?

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:15.630
Yes, I'm fine.

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:21.610
<i>I believe I warned you.</i>

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.860
<i>You shouldn't have that mana crystal.</i>

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:29.790
<i>Mana crystals hold raw magic power.</i>

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:34.960
<i>In the hands of humans, they cause 
all manner of misfortune...</i>

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:39.540
<i>and frighteningly bad luck!</i>

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:43.420
<i>Today, I left my mana crystal at home.</i>

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.560
<i>Now that I know she can't steal it 
from me, I'm not scared of her at all!</i>

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:54.350
<i>The Great Jahy's strategy was to take 
advantage of the magical girl</i>

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:59.000
<i>being physically and emotionally exhausted 
from the mana crystal's influence.</i>

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:03.190
<i>Then, after taking the mana crystal back,
she would beat her to a pulp.</i>

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.110
<i>Let's see...</i>

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.270
<i>Nice. That's the ticket.</i>

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.890
<b>Craft
Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.590
<i>She's totally drowning in misfortune,</i>

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.730
<i>but she's not affected whatsoever.</i>

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:58.900
<i>How?</i>

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:09.230
<i>What is this place?</i>

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.040
She's completely soaked!

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.770
It did start pouring suddenly.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:22.360
Why didn't she use her umbrella?

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.730
She probably didn't have one.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.530
Fortune of Misfortune

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:34.340
<i>What?!</i>

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:36.480
Oh, no!

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:37.620
Teacher!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.210
Jingu-san is...

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.000
What happened?!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.860
It's fine. The nurse's office will do.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.260
<i>She...</i>

00:15:57.440 --> 00:16:00.200
Come on, this isn't the time 
to feel sympathy for her!

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:03.440
Today's the day I take my mana crystal back!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.900
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:17.440
<i>On with my strategy.</i>

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:19.280
<i>This is the perfect opportunity.</i>

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:22.000
<i>All right, time to get it back!</i>

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.080
My mana crystal!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.380
You're awake?!

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:42.520
It's you... from that one time.

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:49.120
I wouldn't have expected you 
to come all the way here.

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:55.250
<i>Stop being scared!</i>

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:56.370
<i>Stop being afraid!</i>

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:57.900
<i>She's weakened.</i>

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:00.540
<i>Now's your chance!</i>

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:09.500
T-Today's the day you g-give me
back my mana crystal.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.950
Ah, there's no need to thank me.
Your gratitude is thanks enough.

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.550
Listen to me!

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:18.300
You came to thank me 
for taking the crystal off of you.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.510
What're you on about?!

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:27.140
Today, I shouldered all this 
misfortune for carrying the crystal again.

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:30.100
If I hadn't done that, it would 
have happened to someone else.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:35.140
When I think about that... my heart races!

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:46.390
It's true that the mana crystal's 
misfortune is terrifying.

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:50.750
Which is why it's a burden I should carry.

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:57.220
I don't want to see anyone else cry again
because of the curse of the mana crystal.

00:17:58.170 --> 00:18:00.980
That's why I became a magical girl.

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:07.130
<i>I thought you were doing this because you're
 some sort of masochistic pervert...</i>

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:10.960
<i>But she's...</i>

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:17.860
I've said it before, but I eventually intend
to destroy the mana crystals I collect.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:19.980
<i>Destroy them?!</i>

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:24.180
Ah!

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:26.860
Someone might be facing misfortune right now!

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.110
I can't just sit here!

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:33.260
Apologies, but we'll have to continue
this conversation when we have more time.

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:03.090
Farewell, little girl!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:04.440
May we meet again!

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:05.910
Hup!

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:12.710
How are you feeling, Jingu-san?

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.220
Who are you?!

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:16.920
I didn't do anything!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.260
Hey, wait!

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:21.820
Look!

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:23.180
Oh, how cute!

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:26.300
What's a grade schooler doing here?

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:27.680
Where'd you come from?

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:28.850
Are you lost?

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:29.890
She's so small!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.940
What a weird T-shirt.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.290
That's an odd hairstyle.

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:34.270
So cute!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:37.050
Get your filthy hands off of me! How rude!

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:38.780
Or are you looking for a slaughter fest?!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.670
What is that, like some kind of festival?

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:44.780
Oh, I love little feisty kids like her!

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:46.640
Stop it!

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:47.660
Wait!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.790
Never!

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:51.750
<i>Damn that magical girl!</i>

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:52.920
<i>What's up with her?</i>

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.840
<i>She's human yet doesn't fear misfortune.</i>

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.930
<i>Then there's her obsession
 with the mana crystals.</i>

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:00.720
<i>And that power...</i>

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:07.370
<i>It's true that the mana crystal's 
misfortune is terrifying.</i>

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:10.990
<i>Which is why it's a burden I should carry.</i>

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:16.940
<i>I don't want to see anyone else cry again
because of the curse of the mana crystal.</i>

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:21.620
<i>That's why I became a magical girl.</i>

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:22.620
<i>Why...</i>

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:23.780
<i>Why would she go that far?</i>

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.370
<i>Snap out of it!</i>

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:33.850
<i>Anyway, I need to do whatever it takes to get
those crystals back before she destroys them!</i>

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:25.380
Somebody, please help!

00:22:32.480 --> 00:22:34.240
Thank you so much!

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:36.870
It was nothing.

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:53.500
A-Are... you okay?

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:56.060
Yes, this is not a problem.

00:22:56.060 --> 00:22:57.060
Farewell.

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:01.280
I got this!

00:23:02.370 --> 00:23:03.350
My purse!

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:04.490
You won't get away!

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:06.280
Pervert!

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:07.540
Not on my watch!

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:18.050
I was able to take on the misfortunes 
of others again today.

00:23:18.050 --> 00:23:20.830
There's no better feeling than this!

00:23:21.090 --> 00:23:25.800
I'm going to save more and 
more people from misfortune!

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.980
<b>The Landlord Can't Come Home...</b>
